WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.000
-You know, it can be hard
to make big life decisions,

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.934
but I have someone here
who can help.

00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:08.701
It's time for "Life Coach
with Jerry Seinfeld."

00:00:08.701 --> 00:00:13.701
-♪ Life Coach
with Jerry Seinfeld ♪

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:15.334
-I am joined now
by Jerry Seinfeld.

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:17.501
Jerry, are you there?

00:00:17.501 --> 00:00:20.267
-Jimmy, I am here. I am ready.

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:22.901
Let's do some comedy!

00:00:22.901 --> 00:00:25.501
-Jerry, you are not afraid
to speak your mind.

00:00:25.501 --> 00:00:26.667
I love hearing your take
on things.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:28.801
So we asked viewers at home --
-I do, too.

00:00:28.801 --> 00:00:30.567
-To --
-I love my mind.

00:00:30.567 --> 00:00:33.400
-Thank you.
-And I love my take on things.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.200
-We asked viewers at home
to send in questions

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.968
that they need your coaching on.

00:00:36.968 --> 00:00:39.634
Are you ready to give out
some tough advice?

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:41.300
-I am. But I'm going
to tell you right now,

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.734
my advice to most people
with most questions

00:00:43.734 --> 00:00:45.234
is just going to be,

00:00:45.234 --> 00:00:47.667
shave your head,
move to Phoenix.

00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:49.200
-[ Laughing ] Okay, good.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.367
-Just start over.

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:53.334
That's gonna be my advice
99% of the time,

00:00:53.334 --> 00:00:54.734
no matter what your problem is.

00:00:54.734 --> 00:00:56.601
-Yeah. I understand.

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:58.300
-Okay. But I love
this kind of thing,

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.634
'cause I do have opinions
on everything.

00:01:00.634 --> 00:01:03.000
They're not correct.
They're just mine.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.334
-Okay. This first one --

00:01:05.334 --> 00:01:07.567
"My girlfriend
goes to bed early..."

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:20.334
-Yes. And you're also a moron,

00:01:20.334 --> 00:01:23.567
because all you have to do
is get in bed with her.

00:01:23.567 --> 00:01:25.968
First of all,
do what she wants to do.

00:01:25.968 --> 00:01:28.767
If she wants to go to bed early,
you go to bed early.

00:01:28.767 --> 00:01:32.334
-Yeah.
-She will fall asleep!

00:01:32.334 --> 00:01:35.133
Then you get up
and do what you want.

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:37.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.033 --> 00:01:38.133
Idiot!

00:01:38.133 --> 00:01:39.701
-Exactly -- I told you --

00:01:39.701 --> 00:01:41.734
That is exactly right.
What are you doing --

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.501
Why are you causing a problem?
-Yes, let her fall asleep!

00:01:43.501 --> 00:01:44.934
She's never going to know.

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:46.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:48.467
-Causing such a big problem
while she's awake?

00:01:48.467 --> 00:01:50.734
She's got -- Yeah, exactly.
-Yeah.

00:01:50.734 --> 00:01:52.501
You think she can hear
your eyes open?

00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:54.100
She can't.

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.834 --> 00:01:58.367
-Here's another question.

00:01:58.367 --> 00:02:00.901
"My unemployed friend has been
crashing at my place

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:02.200
for six months."

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.033
That's not the problem yet.

00:02:16.334 --> 00:02:18.868
-You are not Paul McCartney.

00:02:18.868 --> 00:02:21.367
You cannot let it be.

00:02:21.367 --> 00:02:24.334
[ Laughter ]
Tell this person --

00:02:24.334 --> 00:02:27.267
You have to confront them, yes.
You're going to do it --

00:02:27.267 --> 00:02:29.300
You know, if you don't
tell them about this,

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:31.767
you're going to act it out
in other ways,

00:02:31.767 --> 00:02:33.601
slamming cupboards

00:02:33.601 --> 00:02:36.868
and, you know,
knocking things over.

00:02:36.868 --> 00:02:41.400
Get -- Tell him, "Look,
this is bothering me."

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.667
Don't be so -- Don't be so weak.

00:02:43.667 --> 00:02:45.501
And shave your head
and move to Phoenix.

00:02:45.501 --> 00:02:48.567
-Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Alright, here's one.

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:51.167
"My brother is about to have
his first child..."

00:03:02.834 --> 00:03:05.801
-No! Shut up.
It's none of your business.

00:03:05.801 --> 00:03:07.734
Saffron is a beautiful name.

00:03:07.734 --> 00:03:09.467
It's a beautiful color.

00:03:09.467 --> 00:03:11.901
None of your business.

00:03:11.901 --> 00:03:14.567
And need I say...
-Yeah.

00:03:14.567 --> 00:03:16.167
-...shave your head
and move to Phoenix.

00:03:16.167 --> 00:03:18.434
-Yeah. No, no, you don't even
have to say that. Yeah, exactly.

00:03:18.434 --> 00:03:21.467
I like this one. "I'm
a bridesmaid in a wedding..."

00:03:32.901 --> 00:03:35.801
-Yeah. You can,
but Cabo's pretty good.

00:03:35.801 --> 00:03:38.167
I would go to Cabo. Why not?
That's pretty good.

00:03:38.167 --> 00:03:40.567
That's not a bad wedding place.

00:03:40.567 --> 00:03:44.367
Anything you don't want to do
is probably --

00:03:44.367 --> 00:03:45.701
You're going to enjoy it.

00:03:45.701 --> 00:03:48.968
That's -- That's my
kind of M.O. in life.

00:03:48.968 --> 00:03:50.934
Anything my wife wants me to do,

00:03:50.934 --> 00:03:52.934
I absolutely don't
want to do it,

00:03:52.934 --> 00:03:55.767
and I'm always glad I did it.

00:03:55.767 --> 00:03:57.567
-You don't -- For the most part,
you don't want --

00:03:57.567 --> 00:03:59.467
like to do things?

00:03:59.467 --> 00:04:01.767
-No. Whatever --
Whatever anyone wants me to do,

00:04:01.767 --> 00:04:04.033
I don't want to do it.
If I want to do it,

00:04:04.033 --> 00:04:07.534
if it was my idea,
even that, I don't want to do.

00:04:07.534 --> 00:04:11.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:15.868
-So, if you have an idea
of something you want to do --

00:04:15.868 --> 00:04:17.200
-Yeah.
-There's -- What percentage?

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.067
-50/50, I'm gonna like that.

00:04:19.067 --> 00:04:21.133
-[ Laughs ]
-And it's my idea.

00:04:21.133 --> 00:04:23.734
-50/50.
-So anybody else's idea --

00:04:23.734 --> 00:04:26.067
That's why
I can't stand vacations,

00:04:26.067 --> 00:04:28.701
because a vacation
is someone else's idea

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:30.300
of what you're going to like.

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:32.367
-Yeah.
-They think you'll like this.

00:04:32.367 --> 00:04:35.100
They think you want
to zip-line and kayak.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.000
[ Laughter ]

00:04:39.133 --> 00:04:43.400
-You go, "Do I look like the guy
who zip-lines and kayaks?"

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:46.734
-Zip-line is like,
you know, like --

00:04:46.734 --> 00:04:49.467
like I need to know what it
feels like to be dry cleaning.

00:04:49.467 --> 00:04:52.634
That's what zip-lining is.

00:04:52.634 --> 00:04:55.000
I want to have that experience.
I would do a zip-line

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:58.534
where after the zip-line,
they put me in clear plastic

00:04:58.534 --> 00:05:00.801
and on a hook in the back
of somebody else's car

00:05:00.801 --> 00:05:02.100
back to the hotel.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:05.267
Give me the full experience
of being dry cleaning.

00:05:05.267 --> 00:05:07.367
[ Laughter ]

00:05:13.968 --> 00:05:15.167
-"Jerry, I've been secretly

00:05:15.167 --> 00:05:17.767
using my girlfriend's
expensive shampoo..."

00:05:20.934 --> 00:05:23.300
-Ah, good. I like that.

00:05:27.501 --> 00:05:28.934
Yeah.

00:05:30.701 --> 00:05:34.667
No. There are other things you
do that make you a bad person,

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:36.400
but not this.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:38.701
This -- This, I like.

00:05:38.701 --> 00:05:42.234
Screw her.
Screw the fancy shampoo people.

00:05:42.234 --> 00:05:43.901
-Yeah.
-Keep the scam going

00:05:43.901 --> 00:05:44.934
as long as you can.

00:05:44.934 --> 00:05:46.467
I think it's very creative.

00:05:46.467 --> 00:05:48.567
Very inventive.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:48.567 --> 00:05:50.634
-"Very creative."
You are ridiculous.

00:05:50.634 --> 00:05:52.200
[ Giggles ]

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.868
Alright. Here we go.
Last one here.

00:05:53.868 --> 00:05:56.367
"We've been ordering lots of
takeout during the last year..."

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:11.501
-This is -- Again,
this is so simple.

00:06:11.501 --> 00:06:13.667
I cannot believe
the stupidity of this.

00:06:13.667 --> 00:06:15.801
Just take a bottle of ketchup

00:06:15.801 --> 00:06:19.400
and open each one and put it in.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.667
Put it in.

00:06:20.667 --> 00:06:25.167
And let her
catch you doing that.

00:06:25.167 --> 00:06:26.968
-And then if she -- Yeah.
-Let her find you,

00:06:26.968 --> 00:06:30.100
when she comes home from work,
sitting there...

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.601
-Doing that all day long.
-...putting them in

00:06:31.601 --> 00:06:34.033
one after the other. But, yeah,

00:06:34.033 --> 00:06:36.868
maybe you and the shampoo guy
could hang out.

00:06:36.868 --> 00:06:38.901
-Or --
-Or --

00:06:38.901 --> 00:06:40.968
-Shave your head
and move to Phoenix.

00:06:40.968 --> 00:06:42.133
-Thank you very much.

00:06:42.133 --> 00:06:44.133
That's all the time we have
for "Life Coach."

00:06:44.133 --> 00:06:46.300
My thanks to the great
Jerry Seinfeld!

